Name: pnfsdsfile
Description: display a pNFS data storage file's location(s) and/or modify the “pnfsd.dsfile” extended attribute for them
URL: https://man.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=pnfsdsfile&manpath=FreeBSD+15.0-RELEASE
Version: 15.0
License: NOASSERTION
Source: https://cgit.freebsd.org/src/tree/usr.sbin/pnfsdsfile?h=stable/15
Requires: lib.csu \
	lib.libc \
	lib.libcompiler_rt
